        70.86609649658203,
        416.343017578125,
        526.5013427734375,
        427.0980224609375
      ],
      "text": "CI: confidence interval; DST: drug susceptibility testing; NGS: next-generation sequencing; Se: sensitivity; Sp:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.14300537109375,
        317.5381774902344,
        437.89801025390625
      ],
      "text": "specificity; TB: tuberculosis; WGS: whole genome sequencing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.9062194824219,
        527.118896484375,
        468.0512390136719
      ],
      "text": "There were no data on the impact of targeted NGS on patient outcomes such as time to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.4062194824219,
        235.14878845214844,
        483.5512390136719
      ],
      "text": "treatment or treatment outcome.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.5640869140625,
        526.9811401367188,
        507.47808837890625
      ],
      "text": "PICO 2: Should targeted NGS be used to diagnose drug resistance in patients with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.0640869140625,
        442.1455993652344,
        522.9780883789062
      ],
      "text": "bacteriologically confirmed rifampicin-resistant pulmonary TB disease?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.9141235351562,
        526.9261474609375,
        547.0591430664062
      ],
      "text": "The available evidence varied by drug, from 12 studies with 1440 participants for sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.4141235351562,
        526.9616088867188,
        562.5591430664062
      ],
      "text": "of isoniazid to three studies with 31 participants for sensitivity of bedaquiline ( ).  Table 2.4.5.2",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.9141235351562,
        475.9786071777344,
        578.0591430664062
      ],
      "text": "The pooled estimates were determined using a multivariable, mixed-effects model.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.9180297851562,
        526.9666137695312,
        602.0630493164062
      ],
      "text": "The overall certainty was high for some of the drugs. Levofloxacin was downgraded one level",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.4180297851562,
        526.98095703125,
        617.5630493164062
      ],
      "text": "for inconsistency. Bedaquiline and linezolid were downgraded by two levels for imprecision",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.9180297851562,
        527.01416015625,
        633.0630493164062
      ],
      "text": "in sensitivity because the number of resistant samples was below the threshold set and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.4180297851562,
        527.2188110351562,
        648.5630493164062
      ],
      "text": "confidence intervals were wide. Clofazimine was also downgraded by two levels, one for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.9180297851562,
        526.9633178710938,
        664.0630493164062
      ],
      "text": "inconsistency (because two studies were outliers) and another level for imprecision (because",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.4180297851562,
        526.9502563476562,
        679.5630493164062
      ],
      "text": "the confidence intervals were wide). Amikacin was downgraded by one level for sensitivity and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97647476196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.9180297851562,
        526.9569091796875,
        695.0630493164062
      ],
      "text": "specificity because critical concentrations outside those recommended by WHO were used",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.4180297851562,
        527.0086059570312,
        710.5630493164062
      ],
      "text": "for a large proportion of samples. Amikacin sensitivity was further downgraded by two more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.9180297851562,
        527.0029296875,
        726.0630493164062
      ],
      "text": "levels, one for inconsistency and the other for imprecision. Ethambutol was downgraded by",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.4180297851562,
        526.6547241210938,
        741.5630493164062
      ],
      "text": "one level for risk of bias because different samples were used for the index and reference tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986991882324219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.9180297851562,
        527.2556762695312,
        757.0630493164062
      ],
      "text": "Streptomycin specificity was downgraded by two levels, one for inconsistency and the other for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96579647064209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.4180297851562,
        524.417236328125,
        772.5630493164062
      ],
      "text": "imprecision. The overall certainty of the evidence for test accuracy ranged from high to very low.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951090812683105,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 107",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
